    "rich_text_qR6ryP": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_8mDUXt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Trusted Tribute Candles for Homes, Synagogues, and Community Services",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "border_Nwjwyp": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_39h84D": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>These remembrance candles are made for settings where reliability and respect matter. With sturdy wicks and consistent wax quality, each tribute candle burns evenly from start to finish. These candles create a calm environment for storytelling, prayer, and collective remembrance. Many people keep these candles for use throughout the year, lighting them during family gatherings or at home altars to maintain a sense of connection.</p><p>The collection includes options suited to different traditions and timeframes. A 26-hour candle is a simple choice for overnight reflection or short observance. The 3-day and 7-day options are ideal for structured rituals, while the 9-day memorial candle provides continuous light for extended remembrance. Bulk sets make planning easier for synagogues, spiritual centers, funeral services, and families who want to have memorial candles ready for future dates. Every candle in this collection is designed to provide steady comfort and a respectful ambiance. </p><p>If you are selecting candles for memorial use for upcoming dates on the calendar, consider keeping a few extras ready for family observances throughout the year. These remembrance candles and tribute candles are designed to support meaningful traditions with a respectful presentation and dependable performance. </p><p>Browse the selection, choose the memorial candles that fit your needs, and place your order with confidence. </p><p>Our team is available to help with group orders and guidance if needed.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_8mDUXt",
        "border_Nwjwyp",
        "text_39h84D"
      ],
