    "rich_text_bcyQTj": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_gaghg6": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Memorial Candles FAQ",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "spacer_nGzCtY": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_Fh8c7n": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What memorial candle burn times do you offer?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_6we8Af": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer memorial candles in 26-hour, 3-day, 7-day, and 9-day formats so you can choose the candle that fits the length of your observance. This gives families a simpler way to match the candle to a yahrzeit, a shiva period, a tribute display, or an extended remembrance setting.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_cXpkBg": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_EbRww4": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Which memorial candle should I choose for yahrzeit?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_PGdjix": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A 26-hour memorial candle is a strong choice for yahrzeit because it suits a one-day remembrance with a steady, respectful burn. If you prefer a longer format for your space or family tradition, we also offer extended-burn options.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_cjcYUe": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_8nt3x6": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Which memorial candle is best for shiva?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_kdUAnc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A 7-day memorial candle is usually the most practical choice for shiva because it aligns with the traditional mourning period. We also carry 3-day and 9-day candles for families who want a different burn length based on custom or household preference.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_fnVbRe": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_DtdrhQ": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are your memorial candles unscented?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_Ahigmc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Our memorial candles are unscented, so the flame feels calm and respectful in homes, synagogues, funeral settings, and gathering spaces without adding fragrance to the room.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_3Npipb": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_xYWUae": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I use these candles for funeral services and tribute tables?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_BeY7gK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Our memorial candles are well-suited for funeral services, tribute displays, remembrance tables, and quiet spaces set aside for reflection. Many families choose them when they want a candle that feels traditional, steady, and appropriate for solemn moments.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_HkdPLd": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_hn9FBU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do you offer memorial candles in packs for families or community use?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_qmzRU3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. At Kisco Candles, we offer memorial candles in several pack sizes, including smaller multi-packs and larger pack options for families, synagogues, schools, and community organizations that need more than one candle at a time.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_pwKmfW": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_fWLAVV": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How do I choose between a 3-day, 7-day, and 9-day memorial candle?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_gcbcbB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choose the burn time based on how long you want the candle to remain lit and how you plan to use it in the space. A 3-day candle works well for a shorter tribute period, a 7-day candle suits a week-long remembrance, and a 9-day candle is a good fit when you want longer-lasting light without replacement.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_AticPg": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_ggY3xw": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are your memorial candles a good fit for home use?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_7MJ9tF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Our memorial candles are a strong fit for home remembrance because they are unscented, calm in appearance, and available in burn times that suit both short and extended observances.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_XFUVYa": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_cb8mz9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I keep the same candle style for repeated annual remembrance?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_6bWY6i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Many families prefer to reorder the same memorial candle each year for consistency and tradition. Keeping the same burn time and format can make annual remembrance feel simpler and more familiar.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_hVDWjF": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_XxyHcE": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why buy memorial candles from Kisco Candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_daDLHk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We make it easier to find respectful, unscented memorial candles in the burn times families actually need. Our assortment is built around practical remembrance formats rather than general décor candles, so you can choose with more confidence.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
